FixNear.AI 🇵🇰
AI-Powered Local Service Discovery and Problem Triage for Pakistan
Describe the problem. Find the right solution.

🔗 Live Application: https://fixnear-ai.vercel.app

📌 Project Overview

FixNear.AI is an AI-powered local service discovery platform designed to help people in Pakistan find the right professional for everyday household, technical, automotive, and repair-related problems.

The platform solves a simple but common problem:

People often know that something is wrong, but they do not know what type of professional they need.

For example, a user may know that:

their air conditioner is not cooling,
their electricity keeps tripping,
their water pump has stopped working,
their Wi-Fi is slow,
their motorcycle will not start,
their washing machine is making unusual noises,

but they may not know whether they need an electrician, an appliance technician, an AC technician, a plumber, a mechanic, or another specialist.

FixNear.AI allows users to describe the problem naturally in English or Roman Urdu. The AI analyzes the description and recommends the most appropriate service category and professional.

The user can then:

Select their location.
Describe their problem.
Receive an AI-powered analysis.
View the recommended service category.
Browse matching local service providers.
Select a provider.
Submit a service request.
Receive a unique request tracking ID.
View their submitted requests.

The result is a complete end-to-end journey from:

PROBLEM
   ↓
AI UNDERSTANDING
   ↓
SERVICE RECOMMENDATION
   ↓
LOCAL PROVIDER DISCOVERY
   ↓
SERVICE REQUEST
   ↓
REQUEST TRACKING
🎯 The Real-World Problem

Finding a reliable service professional is a common problem for households across Pakistan.

When a household problem occurs, users typically have to:

Search Google or social media.
Guess what type of technician they need.
Search through unrelated results.
Contact multiple people.
Explain the problem repeatedly.
Try to estimate whether the quoted price is reasonable.
Find someone who operates in their area.

This process can be confusing, especially for people who do not understand technical terminology.

For example, a user may write:

"Mera AC chal raha hai lekin thanda nahi kar raha."

The user may not know whether the problem is related to:

the compressor,
gas/refrigerant,
airflow,
electrical components,
filters,
or another technical issue.

They do not necessarily need a technical diagnosis. They first need help understanding:

What kind of professional should I contact?

This is the problem FixNear.AI addresses.

💡 The FixNear.AI Solution

FixNear.AI acts as an intelligent first step between a user and the local service marketplace.

Instead of asking users to search for a technician immediately, the platform allows them to begin with the problem itself.

Example:
User Input
Mera AC thanda nahi kar raha.
AI Output
Recommended Service:
AC Repair

Professional Required:
AC Technician

Possible Issue:
Possible cooling or airflow-related issue.

Urgency:
Medium

Safe First Step:
Avoid attempting to open or repair the internal components yourself.

Recommended Next Step:
Contact a qualified AC technician for inspection.

Estimated Cost:
Local market estimate in PKR.

The user is then shown suitable providers associated with the recommended service category and selected location.

This makes the process:

Problem-first instead of technician-first.

That is the central product idea behind FixNear.AI.

👥 Who Is FixNear.AI For?

FixNear.AI is designed for:

🏠 Households

People who need help finding the right technician for household problems.

👨‍🎓 Students

Students living away from home who may not know local technicians or technical terminology.

🏢 Renters

Tenants who need to quickly identify the appropriate service professional for a problem in their residence.

👵 Elderly Users

Users who may find it difficult to search through multiple service providers manually.

🔧 Non-Technical Users

People who can describe a problem but do not know the technical name for it.

🇵🇰 Pakistani Users

Users who naturally communicate using a mixture of English, Urdu, and Roman Urdu.

⭐ What Makes FixNear.AI Different?

FixNear.AI is not designed as a generic international marketplace.

It is specifically localized for Pakistan.

The platform focuses on:

🇵🇰 Pakistani Locations

The marketplace includes Pakistani cities and local areas.

